A '''Shriveled Cornea''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Reforge Stone]] that applies the {{reforge|Bloodshot}} [[Reforge]] to [[Belts]]. Its recipe is unlocked at {{coll|Spider Slayer 8}}. It grants {{stat|str}}, {{stat|cd}} and {{stat|cc}}.

