=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Shriveled Cornea''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].
==Usage==
===Reforging===
'''Shriveled Cornea''' can be combined with a [[Belt]] using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Bloodshot}} reforge, to grant {{stat|str}}, {{stat|cd}} and {{stat|cc}}, which scale with the Belt's rarity. This has a skill requirement of {{skill|mining|27}}. A Belt that is already reforged to {{reforge|Bloodshot}} will grant the stats, even if the player doesn't meet the requirement to apply it.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{blue|Bloodshot Bonus}}''', which allows the player a {{chance|2.5%|1|40}} to [[Cocoon]] killed mobs. This cannot trigger in [[Dungeons]], [[Kuudra]] or against bosses. 
