== Trivia ==
*On release, it was possible to get the {{Reforge|Bloodshot}} reforge on [[Belts]] via the {{NPCSprite|Blacksmith}}.
**This was patched by effectively removing all applied {{Reforge|Bloodshot}} reforges from items (by making the {{code|bloodshot}} modifier a no-op and changing newly applied reforges to {{code|blood_shot}}). Players who applied their reforges legitimately were refunded.
* Despite it being possible to apply {{Reforge|Bloodshot}} to a {{Item|Safari Belt}}, [[Cocooning]] does not work in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

